stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Boot

    Boot --> WiFiSetupMode: no saved WiFi credentials
    Boot --> Idle: WiFi connects

    WiFiSetupMode --> Idle: provisioning succeeds
    WiFiSetupMode --> IdleNoWiFi: 120s timeout, no setup completed

    Idle --> TagDetecting: tag presence (1st read)
    IdleNoWiFi --> TagDetecting: tag presence (1st read)
    Idle --> IdleNoWiFi: WiFi/Spoolman connection lost
    IdleNoWiFi --> Idle: WiFi/Spoolman connection restored

    TagDetecting --> Idle: reads don't confirm (false trigger)
    TagDetecting --> TagReadError: 3 reads, inconsistent/corrupt data
    TagDetecting --> BlankTagFound: 3 reads confirm, tag is unformatted
    TagDetecting --> ValidTagFound: 3 reads confirm, valid OPT data found

    TagReadError --> Idle: tag removed

    BlankTagFound --> AwaitingFormatConfirm: prompt shown, 5s countdown starts
    note right of AwaitingFormatConfirm
        Confirm-by-inaction: OLED shows live
        countdown (5...4...3...2...1).
        LED blinks, accelerating as it counts
        down (distinct pattern, not reused
        elsewhere). Removing the tag during
        the countdown cancels; leaving it in
        place until 0 confirms.
    end note
    AwaitingFormatConfirm --> FormattingAndRegistering: countdown reaches 0, tag still present
    AwaitingFormatConfirm --> Idle: tag removed during countdown (cancelled)
    FormattingAndRegistering --> Present: stub Spool created, tag formatted

    ValidTagFound --> ForeignTagFound: nfc_id not in Spoolman (valid data, just not registered yet)
    ValidTagFound --> WeighingAndSync: nfc_id matches an existing spool

    ForeignTagFound --> RegisteringForeignTag: decode tag's own Main-section data (vendor, material, color, weight)
    RegisteringForeignTag --> WeighingAndSync: Vendor/Filament/Spool found-or-created from the tag's own data
    ForeignTagFound --> Idle: tag removed
    RegisteringForeignTag --> Idle: tag removed mid find-or-create

    WeighingAndSync --> Present: weigh once, write Aux+Main as needed, PATCH Spoolman

    Present --> ReconcilingMainSection: 1s poll detects Spoolman change
    ReconcilingMainSection --> Present: tag rewritten, cache updated
    Present --> Idle: tag removed (2 consecutive misses)

    Present --> SpoolmanUnreachable: API call fails
    WeighingAndSync --> SpoolmanUnreachable: API call fails
    SpoolmanUnreachable --> Present: connectivity restored, retry succeeds
    SpoolmanUnreachable --> Idle: tag removed
